  "slug": "disabled-children-and-their-families",
  "title": "Disabled Children and their Families - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "A forum for families, carers, young disabled people and experts to come together with Senedd Members to discuss the challenges facing disabled children in Wales. The CPG will raise awareness, share knowledge and promote cross-party discussion on issues such as respite care, financial pressures, inclusion, education, health and social care support. The group will meet up four times a year across Wales and build on the existing S.P.A.C.E. (Stakeholder Parent and Carer Engagement) network to ensure the lived experiences of families help inform discussions across the Senedd.",
